  "description": "Na So-Cheon, a great warrior who was framed for murdering his master, arrives at the capital city of Empire in search of the answer to clean his reputation and to fulfill the promise he made to the swordmaster who saved his life. He must return the jade figurine to Yeon Jin-Hwi, a cold-blooded king who is physically blind but keener in every other way. Will Na So-Cheon ever find a way back into his former life and prove his innocence? \n\n(Source: Pocket Comics) \n\n*Note: Chapter count includes a prologue.*",
